{0 ocgsk}

The {b ocgsk} package provides OCaml bindings for GSK 4, the GTK scene graph:
render nodes and transforms for drawing widgets. They are generated from
GSK's GObject introspection data.

{%html:<a href="../ocgtk/conventions.html">The conventions page</a>%} explains how the bindings are organised and how GObject maps onto OCaml.

{1 Modules}

The library is reached as {!Ocgsk}, with one module per class, interface or
record, such as {!Ocgsk.Render_node} and {!Ocgsk.Transform}.

{b {{!page-modules}All classes and records}}

{ul
{- {!Ocgsk.Enums} — enumerations and bitfields. }
{- {!Ocgsk.Raw} — the C externals and abstract types the modules above are
   built on. }
}

{1 Dependencies}

It builds on {!Ocglib} (GLib and GObject), {!Occairo}, {!Ocgdk},
{!Ocgdkpixbuf}, {!Ocgio}, {!Ocgraphene}, {!Ocpango} and {!Ocpangocairo}.
